      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i know but like if i just take the aspirin and stay on the couch for a day or two to see if the swelling goes down, would that be okay? i really dont think i need an ambulance, it's probably just a cramp or something from sitting so long. if i keep an eye on it, how long do i have before it becomes a real problem?",
