      "content": "I understand your hesitation, but DVT can rapidly worsen, leading to a pulmonary embolism, which is a potentially fatal condition. Swelling and pain can be early signs, but they can also be misleading. If you choose to wait, you risk serious complications. I strongly urge you to seek medical attention immediately. It's better to be cautious and get checked out than to regret not doing so later. Your health is too important to gamble with.",
